Error [jet.CredentialValueDenied]: A `Credential` value is denied at `log.debug`
  --> tests/ui/taint/credential_is_denied_at_every_log_level.jet:5:9
    |
  5 |     log.debug(token)
    |         ^^^^^
 Why: `log.debug` writes to a log, terminal, or serialized output, where a credential would leak
 Fix: Log a non-secret field, or pass the value through a matching `#Scrub(Credential)` function
